 "title": "Regulation of Gene Expression in Yeast",
 "summary": "This cluster revolves around the regulation of gene expression in yeast, specifically focusing on the gene YGP1 and its interactions with other genes and proteins. YGP1 is co-regulated with HSP26, RNR1, and SIC1, and regulates the genes HAA1, IXR1, and PUF5. PUF5 is dependent on IXR1 and regulates HAA1. The study of YGP1 was conducted by Megumi Sato, and the data from this study has been made fully available in a manuscript published in PLOS ONE. The manuscript was deemed suitable for publication by the PLOS ONE Editorial Office Staff.",
